{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/idsgj8","slideIndex":0,"text":"NeuroLearn is a web-based adaptive learning companion. The current prototype focuses on Data Structures and Algorithms. The broader proposal combines the learner model, prerequisite knowledge graph and a pretrained language model for teaching.\n\nSources: C:/Users/asus1/Downloads/project_synopsis.pdf, page 1. Illustration generated for this presentation using the built-in image generation tool. Prompt: editorial 3D paper sculpture of a branching knowledge network growing from an open book, teal and ivory nodes with an amber path on a navy background, no text."}
