{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/lw9ymr","slideIndex":2,"text":"The first domain is DSA, with a predefined graph covering ten topics. The prototype selects a 15-question diagnostic from 100 authored questions. It stores response time, but the stated learner updates use correctness, difficulty and confidence. A dependency-respecting roadmap prioritizes gaps and marks topics as covered when evidence is sufficient. New diagnostic evidence recalculates the path. AI teaching and syllabus extraction remain planned extensions.\n\nSources: C:/Users/asus1/Downloads/project_synopsis.pdf, page 2. Repository: backend/README.md; backend/app/services/assessment_service.py; backend/app/services/roadmap_service.py."}
