{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m3gmei","slideIndex":4,"text":"The interface exchanges validated data with FastAPI services, which access a SQLite database through SQLAlchemy. The knowledge graph is represented by topic and relationship records in relational tables. React Flow visualizes it. Learner model and path-planning services run in the Python backend. Pytest and HTTPX support verification of assessment behavior, confidence handling and roadmap ordering. The language model integration is planned rather than present in the current stack.\n\nSources: C:/Users/asus1/Downloads/project_synopsis.pdf, page 3, Tech Stack. Repository: frontend/package.json; backend/requirements.txt; backend/app/models/; backend/app/services/."}
