{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/86gqyb","slideIndex":5,"text":"Current scope includes the DSA graph, question bank, confidence-aware diagnostic, learner state visualization and personalized roadmap. The next phase adds model-guided explanations and practice, topic-level reassessment and syllabus extraction. Evaluation should examine the DSA prototype and a small OS or DBMS example to assess whether the design transfers to another subject. Expected benefits are design goals. The supplied materials do not establish measured learning gains.\n\nSources: C:/Users/asus1/Downloads/project_synopsis.pdf, pages 2-3, Proposed Solution and Objectives. Repository: backend/README.md; frontend/src/App.jsx."}